2026-10-09T00:10:45.4283639Z === DST / quarter-grid (subprocess, HASTUB_TZ) ===
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4283646Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4283757Z -- the stub honours HASTUB_TZ
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4283893Z   ok   dt_util carries the configured zone
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4283901Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4284122Z -- solve anchor snaps to the quarter grid (coordinator path)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4284285Z   ok   12:07:33 floors to 12:00:00 with tz and date intact
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4284423Z   ok   a boundary instant is its own anchor
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4284641Z   ok   optimize() receives the snapped anchor, not the raw 12:07 instant
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4284860Z   ok   every published plan timestamp lands on a :00/:15/:30/:45 boundary
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4285162Z   ok   step 0's price is the quarter in force at 12:07 — the 12:00 hour's
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4285381Z   ok   the wall-clock action lookup lands on step 0, no pre-horizon clamp
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4285548Z   ok   filed lead promises mature on quarter boundaries
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4285780Z   ok   an override expiring 12:05 still pins the [12:00, 12:15) step at 12:07
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4285952Z   ok   and frees every step starting at or past the expiry
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4286141Z   ok   the not-yet-expired override is kept, not dropped eagerly
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4286155Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4286355Z -- window snap: day-anchored, across both DST transitions
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4286561Z   ok   15/30/60-minute snaps match the old keys exactly, fold included
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4286751Z   ok   the 25-hour autumn day meters 25 distinct 60-minute windows
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4287039Z   ok   120-minute windows advance the hour on the fold day (0,0,2,2,4,4,…)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4287237Z   ok   and on the gap day, straight through the missing wall hour
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4287404Z   ok   a 12:10 and a 13:30 sample share one 120-minute window
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4287590Z   ok   elapsed inside a 120-minute window can exceed an hour
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4287792Z   ok   the window closes on the 2-hour boundary, not every wall hour
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4287989Z   ok   window_factors samples 12:00/14:00/16:00, not 13:00/15:00/17:00
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4288003Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4288140Z -- planning grid on DST days (#243)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4288315Z   ok   all six transition days align prices to real instants
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4288436Z   ok   the plain day stays a zero null
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4288811Z   ok   _forecast_arrays and _price_series agree on the spring grid
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4289051Z   ok   _Horizon.timestamps invents no spring phantom
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4289371Z   ok   one horizon clock: the coordinator's import IS the optimizer's
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4289727Z   ok   coordinator and optimizer stamp the same spring grid
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4289931Z   ok   and on a step that is not a whole number of minutes (spring)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4290210Z   ok   coordinator and optimizer stamp the same autumn grid
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4290402Z   ok   and on a step that is not a whole number of minutes (autumn)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4290592Z   ok   spring and autumn UTC gaps are 15 minutes, plain day too
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4290745Z   ok   spring plan books no energy on a phantom step
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4290889Z   ok   autumn plan max gap is one 15-minute step
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4290898Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4291125Z -- window_factors across a transition INSIDE the horizon (#777)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4291329Z   ok   the transition really is inside the autumn and spring horizons
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4291551Z   ok   autumn fold: every window bills under the hour the meter keys it at
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4291773Z   ok   spring gap: every window bills under the hour the meter keys it at
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4291987Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the ordinary Saturday a week earlier never disagreed
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4292279Z   ok   and the comparison is not vacuous — both rates occur in every cell
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4292291Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4292467Z -- age seams across the DST transitions (#1299)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4292679Z   ok   a 2 h fold-night outage reads its true age, not the wall clock's
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4292876Z   ok   and crosses the 90-minute stale floor a 2 h outage must cross
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4293042Z   ok   weather staleness across the fold is the true 2 h
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4293246Z   ok   spring gap: the plan age is the true 2 h, not 3 h of wall clock
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4293397Z   ok   spring gap: weather staleness is the true 2 h
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4293573Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain night's ages were always true
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4293785Z   ok   a backward clock step publishes 0 h staleness, not a negative age
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4293963Z   ok   the plan age stays clamped at 0 after the same step
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4294174Z   ok   a fold-night handover 2 h old is refused against a 60-min window
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4294392Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain-night 2 h handover is refused identically
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4294582Z   ok   legionella hours_since reads true elapsed across the fold
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4294783Z   ok   the pump walks the plan by TRUE elapsed steps across the fold
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4294951Z   ok   and that agreement is the OFF the true index commands
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4295177Z   ok   the fold-night outage stamped its last-good at the pre-fold instant
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4295384Z   ok   a mode unreadable for a TRUE 3 h 20 min is expired, not held good
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4295608Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain night expires the same-age mode identically
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4295794Z   ok   a defrost running the fold's true 2 h books 7200 s of duty
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4295964Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain night books the same 7200 s
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4296163Z   ok   and a mixed naive/aware pair is still declined, not guessed
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4296172Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4296393Z -- the forecast grid after the transition (round-9 D14-s4-01)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4296620Z   ok   at noon on every transition day the grid starts at now's own quarter
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4296809Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain day's noon grid was always aligned
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4296817Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4297039Z -- naive stored stamps under the aware clock (round-9 D3-s1-91)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4297252Z   ok   a naive last tick past the gap floor opens the outage window
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4297439Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: a naive last tick 10 min ago opens nothing
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4297683Z   ok   three naive immersion events inside 14 days ask for the readiness margin
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4297923Z   ok   a naive stamp is UTC to utc_elapsed_seconds under a non-UTC process zone
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4297931Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4298267Z -- the UTC helpers themselves across both transitions (round-9 P7)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4298562Z   ok   utc_elapsed_seconds reads 01:30 to 03:30 as 3 h on the autumn day and 1 h on the spring day
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4299162Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: on a plain day 01:30 to 03:30 is 2 h
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4299497Z   ok   utc_shift of 01:30 by 2 h lands on 02:30+01:00 (autumn) and by 1 h on 03:30+02:00 (spring)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4299747Z   ok   an outage across the autumn fold opens both windows at their true instants
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4299756Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4300004Z -- the DST tracer over replayed transition days (round-9 P7 barrier)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4300012Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4300128Z === Stress and economics ===
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4300368Z   ok   the replay lane steps a zoned clock in UTC: every day runs its true cycles
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4300624Z   ok   the replay lane's forecast walk steps one true hour, across both transitions
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4300880Z   ok   the replay lane's price walk labels every true quarter of the day in the zone
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4301112Z   ok   no production seam does wall-clock arithmetic across either transition
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4301330Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain day reads no seam, and the tracer did run
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4301338Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4301594Z -- the manual override lasts its stated length in true time (#1756, D9)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4301879Z   ok   a default override applied the evening before either transition lasts 20 true hours
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4302048Z   ok   a far expires_at is clamped to the same 20 true hours
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4302243Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: on a plain day the 20 hours were always right
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4302540Z   ok   a step ending at the autumn fold stays off for a slot that starts 30 true minutes after it
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4302748Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: a slot that starts inside the step still pins it on
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4302756Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4302952Z -- the DST tracer: config arm and straddle arm (#1756)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4303172Z   ok   every arm runs its true cycles on every day, none failing outright
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4303469Z   ok   arm [tariff 15 min]: no production seam does wall-clock arithmetic across either transition
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4303677Z   ok   NULL CONTROL arm [tariff 15 min]: the plain day reads no seam
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4303976Z   ok   arm [tariff 60 min]: no production seam does wall-clock arithmetic across either transition
