2026-10-09T00:10:45.4546254Z -- #369/#370/#1738 — the duplication window can fire, and --record refuses a laundered regression
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4546514Z   ok   a copy in ANOTHER module is one copy, whatever its locals are called (#1738 a)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4546714Z   ok   a third copy costs one more, not two more: copies, not pairs
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4546954Z   ok   a re-wrap or a comment moves nothing: the window is the AST, not the lines
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4547171Z   ok   the node floor holds: two short shared statements are not a copy
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4547378Z   ok   the shipped window is 2 statements of at least 30 nodes (#1738)
