2026-10-09T00:10:45.4548046Z   ok   cross_seam_edges moving up IS a regression row: the retired ratio's band is gone
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4548305Z   ok   --record REFUSES a worsened metric by default and leaves the table untouched
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4548842Z   ok   an explicit --allow-regression reason lets it through and writes the new value
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4549100Z   ok   a blank reason is refused, so the flag cannot decay into pasted boilerplate
2026-10-09T00:10:45.4549371Z   ok   a pure tightening still records with no flag -- that is the point of the exercise
