2026-10-09T00:10:45.5928910Z === Manual plan override ===
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5928918Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5929052Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5929203Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5929393Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5929516Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5929611Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5929710Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5929832Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5930070Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5930195Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5930319Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5930547Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5930554Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5930669Z -- Channel pin semantics
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5930790Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5930922Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5931037Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5931189Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5931304Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5931441Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5931567Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5931716Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5931898Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5932078Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5932087Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5932203Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5932376Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5932518Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5932647Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5932778Z   ok   from_dict rejects a missing expiry
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5932786Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5932919Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5933086Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5933230Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5933348Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5933479Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5933624Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5933839Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5933999Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5934139Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5934150Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5934337Z -- A quiet Off window outranks a force-on pin (#1910)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5934568Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5934758Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5935002Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5935010Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5935270Z -- An Off window plans the anti-legionella cycle outside itself (#1910)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5935517Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5935728Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5936009Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5936231Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5936404Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5936419Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5936646Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5936879Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5937051Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5937205Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5937356Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5937364Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5937550Z -- Quiet-window arms the solve does not reach (#1910)
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5937709Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5937831Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5937952Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5938246Z   ok   a non-string control and a switch control are domain verdicts
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5938396Z   ok   a power entity with no state is no reading
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5938597Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5938890Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5939102Z   ok   no state callable and a non-positive nameplate measure nothing
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5939239Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5939376Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5939574Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5939819Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5940006Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5940204Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5940427Z   ok   a measured ceiling equal to nameplate does not install a cap array
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5940602Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5940811Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5941031Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5941233Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5941407Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5941646Z   ok   two empty specs parse as nothing; one empty spec does not drop the other
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5941885Z   ok   windows that only touch at an endpoint do not overlap, from either side
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5942141Z   ok   an off window overlapping a silent window is refused even with no hot water
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5942293Z   ok   an off window overlapping hot water is refused
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5942521Z   ok   a weekly quiet spec keeps its day selector through canonicalisation
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5942777Z   ok   absent quiet specs canonicalise to nothing, and a present one round-trips
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5942973Z   ok   a service call whose off window overlaps hot water is refused
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5943203Z   ok   an Off mask with no other cap still zeroes exactly its own space steps
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5943456Z   ok   the plan sensor publishes the not-enforced marker and the resolved actions
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5943684Z   ok   configured_specs returns the stored rows and the not-enforced marker
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5943901Z   ok   the monthly peak sensor publishes the tariff fields it was given
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5944141Z   ok   the default silent fraction is the unset value the fold compares against
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5944149Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5944332Z -- Safety release fires only when a hard floor binds
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5944549Z   ok   forcing space off in the cold releases pins for the comfort floor
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5944696Z   ok   released space steps actually run again
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5944879Z   ok   forcing space off when it is not needed releases nothing
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5945052Z   ok   forcing hot water off with a low tank releases pins
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5945228Z   ok   a due legionella cycle is released when forced off
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5945418Z   ok   forcing hot water off when the tank is hot releases nothing
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5945430Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5945614Z -- A timezone-less expiry is handled, not crashed on
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5945758Z   ok   a naive expiry does not raise TypeError
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5945931Z   ok   the stored expiry is comparable with the parsed slots
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5946106Z   ok   and the override can still be applied to the horizon
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5946290Z   ok   a naive expiry in the past is rejected as a plan error
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5946298Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5946522Z -- Abandoning an unsafe plan does not discard the safe channel
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5946649Z   ok   the breaching channel is abandoned
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5946940Z   ok   the channel that was never unsafe keeps its pins
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5947101Z   ok   so the space plan the user asked for still holds
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5947217Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5947447Z -- A released pin is never reported without being planned around
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5947602Z   ok   a plan that never converges still terminates
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5947741Z   ok   giving up releases every forced-off slot
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5947903Z   ok   the abandoned plan is as warm as planning freely
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5948055Z   ok   and it heats about as much as planning freely
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5948063Z 
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5948210Z -- No override leaves behaviour unchanged
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5948395Z   ok   winter_dhw: passing no pins is byte-for-byte identical
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5948562Z   ok   winter_dhw: no pins means the override is inactive
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5948847Z   ok   summer: passing no pins is byte-for-byte identical
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5949009Z   ok   summer: no pins means the override is inactive
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5949177Z   ok   no_dhw: passing no pins is byte-for-byte identical
2026-10-09T00:10:45.5949328Z   ok   no_dhw: no pins means the override is inactive
